# Stray agent run_code artifacts at repo root (mis-resolved output_dir).
#
# The agent writes its analysis outputs to the process CWD. When output_dir fails to resolve,
# that CWD is the repo root, and an episode's de_results.csv / cna_results.csv / metadata_pca.csv
# / plots land here. The old list enumerated the three filenames we happened to have seen, so the
# next episode's outputs (five CSVs, 2026-08-11) arrived untracked and unexplained.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash so ONLY the repo root is covered — episode copies under results/
# are untouched (results/ is ignored wholesale anyway), and a future scripts/*.csv stays visible.
# Verified before adding: no tracked .csv, .png or .json exists at repo root.
/*.csv
/*.png
grouping_temp.json
grouping.json
test_plot.png

# Manuscript — unpublished paper drafts, figures and strategy docs. Kept local.
#
# NOTE: the 12 files previously tracked here (drafts, PREREGISTRATION.md, figures/*.json) were
# untracked in this commit but REMAIN in the repo's public history. Ignoring a path does not
# unpublish what was already pushed; if these must be non-public, the history needs rewriting or
# the repo needs to be private.
manuscript/
